Z||000003||Brandon86SE||10-18-2001||04:16 PM||||Actually, right on the ebay posting it says that it's built on a Fiero frame!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Also that it's running a Corvette LT1 engine..... I wonder if Archie knows anything about this, could it be one of his engine kits they're using?<P>As far as the McLaren goes though, I've always liked the front of it, but not particularly the back.  I mean, if you're gonna have a car like that, where all anyone's gonna see is your tail end, you want it to look good, right?<P>I'd take a Ferrari, Lambo, or Porsche GT2 over one anyday!  But that's just my opinion.<P>Brandon <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
Z||000004||Slammed Fiero||10-18-2001||04:40 PM||||It says there using s porsche transaxle , which means their probably using a renegade hybird setup for the car. There's probably very little left of a Fiero in that car. From the pics it's missing the roof. And to put a porsche tranny in with a vette motor I imagine a Tubular cradle has to be grafted to the car just behind the firewall.<P>Also.. I have heard of Financial vision before. And a character named Jack Lugas. I don't know much about him. But I have heard numerous bad things about him ripping off people over the last 6 years. I believe Archie knows who he is. <P><BR>That lambo on the top of the products page was the topic of discussion a few months ago here on the forum. I believe it was at carlise , and it was on Ebay for 150K. I thought it was a one off type deal ..Not a kit.<P>JM ||||reg||1
Z||000005||MinnGreenGT||10-18-2001||04:48 PM||||If it does have any thing to do with Jack Lugas (Jay Lucas, Lucas Group Int'l, JLGi, Just Spyders, Technodesign, etc...) Stay as far away as possible.  I've heard numerous horror stories about him and his ripoffs.  I've even seen some of his fiberglass work firsthand- absolutely the worst I've ever seen!  If he is involved- just simply stay away.<P>Check out this consumer alert on him: <A HREF="http://www.kitcar.com/consumeralert/JLGI/home.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kitcar.com/consumeralert/JLGI/home.html</A> ||||reg||1
